<title>PORTUGAL: Telecel announces results on February 12.</title>
<headline>Telecel announces results on February 12.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecel-Comunicacoes Pessoais, the Portuguese mobile phone concern, will announce its 1996 results on February 12, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3113121</p>
</text>
